sing","gap_id":"gap_10_2_01","missing_source_classes":["数据管理系统规格说明"],"target":"数据管理系统类型与数据录入方式"},{"action":"确认PSA、肝肾功能、血糖、HbA1c等实验室检测及经腹超声是否由中心实验室或独立影像核心提供，明确其数据交付路径","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_2_02","missing_source_classes":["中心实验室协议","影像核心实验室协议"],"target":"中心实验室与第三方数据源界定"},{"action":"核实IPSS、QoL、Qmax、PVR、PGI-I、日记等工具是否在所有治疗访视均采集，还是仅在特定访视实施，避免将访视日等同于全部评估实施日","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_2_03","missing_source_classes":["访视操作手册","数据采集时点对照表"],"target":"各评估工具与访视的精确对应关系"}],"heading":"数据源的定义","missing_source_classes":["数据管理系统规格说明","中心实验室与影像核心实验室协议","各评估工具操作手册与采集时点对照表"],"proposal_text":"本研究数据采集涵盖以下来源：受试者报告结局工具，包括国际前列腺症状评分（IPSS）及其生活质量指数（QoL）、受试者整体印象改善评分（PGI-I）以及夜尿次数与每次尿量日记；临床功能评估，包括最大尿流率（Qmax）测定、残余尿量（PVR）测定及自由尿流条件下排尿量记录；影像学检查，包括经腹超声前列腺体积测量；实验室检测，包括血清前列腺特异性抗原（PSA）、肝肾功能、血糖及糖化血红蛋白（HbA1c）；心血管安全性评估，包括坐位血压、心率及12导联心电图（QTcF）；不良事件与特别关注事件报告，涵盖尿潴留、泌尿系感染、生殖系统不良事件及主要心血管不良事件（MACE）；药物依从性与给药记录；随机化分层信息（IPSS严重度13~19与≥20、既往α1阻滞剂暴露有/无）；合并用药与伴发事件记录（含补救治疗即开始其他LUTS药物的记录）。上述数据在筛选期（最长28天）、双盲治疗期（第1至26周）、开放延长期（第27至52周）及治疗结束后安全随访（末次给药后2周）各访视中按方案规定采集。","rationale":"数据采集工具与评估项目依据已确认的访视策略、终点定义及安全性评估要求识别。各工具是否由中心实验室或第三方独立提供、数据如何汇入主数据库、各工具的具体采集时点是否完全等同于访视日，需医学经理与数据管理部门核实。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（α、伴发事件）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_7aafcba68d3a_c2486552765c46eb","section_number":"10.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005185723_6f5f03b6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取数据管理计划或监查计划，明确源数据核查比例、核查方法（100%核查或抽样）、核查频率及责任角色","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_3_01","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","监查计划"],"target":"数据核查方法与频率"},{"action":"获取数据管理计划中关于数据质疑生成、传递、解答、关闭的时限与升级机制","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_3_02","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划"],"target":"数据清理与质疑管理流程"},{"action":"获取DSMB章程，明确每4个月盲态安全审阅所接收的数据集范围、格式及与数据质量保证章节的衔接","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_3_03","missing_source_classes":["DSMB章程"],"target":"DSMB数据审阅的具体数据交付格式与范围"},{"action":"获取CEC操作章程，明确MACE裁定所需的数据来源、裁定时限及裁定结果如何反馈至数据质量保证体系","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_3_04","missing_source_classes":["CEC操作章程"],"target":"CEC裁定流程与数据质量保证的衔接"}],"heading":"数据质量保证","missing_source_classes":["数据管理计划","监查计划","源数据核查方案","数据清理与质疑管理规程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要描述数据质量保证的具体实施框架，包括数据核查方法、监查频率与比例、数据管理流程、源数据核查策略、数据清理与质疑管理、独立数据监查委员会（DSMB）的数据审阅机制等。允许来源中仅提及DSMB每4个月进行盲态安全审阅及MACE由独立CEC裁定，但未提供数据质量保证的完整实施框架、核查方法、频率、责任分工或技术措施。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_7aafcba68d3a_4c32c02d94ad0db5","section_number":"10.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005185723_6f5f03b6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认研究结束后各类资料（源文件、CRF、实验室报告、影像资料、知情同意书）的保存年限及纸质/电子保存方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_4_01","missing_source_classes":["资料保存政策","机构档案管理规定"],"target":"资料保存期限与保存方式"},{"action":"确认电子数据的存储架构、备份频率、灾难恢复方案及数据迁移计划","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_4_02","missing_source_classes":["数据管理系统安全规格","IT基础设施方案"],"target":"电子数据存储与备份策略"},{"action":"确认数据加密方式、访问控制层级、审计追踪要求、受试者去标识化方案及适用的数据保护法规（如个人信息保护法）合规安排","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_4_03","missing_source_classes":["数据保护影响评估","隐私保护方案","法规合规评估"],"target":"数据保护技术措施与隐私保护安排"}],"heading":"资料保存与数据保护","missing_source_classes":["资料保存与数据保护政策","数据保护影响评估","电子数据管理系统安全规格","受试者隐私保护方案"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要明确研究资料（含源文件、CRF、实验室报告、影像资料、知情同意书等）的保存期限、保存方式、电子数据存储与备份策略、数据保护技术措施（加密、访问控制、审计追踪）、受试者隐私保护安排及适用的数据保护法规框架。允许来源中仅确认开发区域为中国、研究分期为III期、多中心设计，但未提供资料保存期限、数据保护技术措施、隐私保护具体安排或适用法规框架。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_7aafcba68d3a_a28a9684c65f7e1b","section_number":"10.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005185723_6f5f03b6","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认本研究结果的发表计划，包括目标期刊类型、发表时间窗口、是否允许多篇发表及发表前审核流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_5_01","missing_source_classes":["数据发布与发表策略文件"],"target":"研究结果发表计划"},{"action":"确认是否向监管机构、第三方研究者或公共数据库提供个体水平数据，明确共享条件、时间窗口及受试者同意范围","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_5_02","missing_source_classes":["数据共享计划"],"target":"数据共享安排"},{"action":"确认本研究在中国临床试验注册中心或ClinicalTrials.gov的注册状态、结果公开时限及公开内容范围","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_10_5_03","missing_source_classes":["临床试验注册与公开义务说明"],"target":"临床试验注册与公开义务"}],"heading":"数据发布和研究发表策略","missing_source_classes":["数据发布与发表策略文件","数据共享计划","临床试验注册与公开义务说明","发表前数据审核流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要描述研究数据的发布策略、研究结果发表计划、数据共享安排及注册平台公开义务。允许来源中确认本研究为III期确证性研究、开发区域为中国、多中心设计，但未提供数据发布策略、发表计划、数据共享安排、注册平台公开义务或发表前数据审核流程的任何信息。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_7aafcba68d3a_ef4e22dc3cae2443","section_number":"10.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"7d9e832e9ac823542685f464d3a1fcc84aa8b68e980f5f21c12d848961d34b51","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_7aafcba68d3a_0edb7a13b36bcc44:full-draft:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:d819bd480dc54a243e91766c1293abc4093589095d35f7bcabdd628318b48e29:087a63d35bb37a41ed4b70c1","text_sha256":"7d9e832e9ac823542685f464d3a1fcc84aa8b68e980f5f21c12d848961d34b51"},{"content_sha256":"b6c04f6db6fde35e37a038ac3c3d1a8463187ca2ae1f46005bfb397145bcfef8","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:revision:4","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_c29c971a255e3e8daba1:r4:4a7fd852182b4175","text_sha256":"b6c04f6db6fde35e37a038ac3c3d1a8463187ca2ae1f46005bfb397145bcfef8"}]}